---
import LandingLayout from "@/layouts/HomeLayout.astro";
---

<LandingLayout title="Terms of Service - Showcrate">
  <div class="relative min-h-screen pb-32">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#80808008_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#80808008_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:32px_32px] pointer-events-none"></div>
    
    <div class="container relative z-10 mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-24 lg:pt-32 max-w-3xl">
      <div class="mb-12 border-b border-border/50 pb-12 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-muted/50 border border-border/50 text-muted-foreground text-sm font-medium">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary animate-pulse"></span>
          Last updated: September 2026
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:text-foreground prose-p:text-muted-foreground prose-a:text-primary hover:prose-a:text-primary/80">
        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>By accessing or using Showcrate, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you disagree with any part of the terms, then you may not access the service.</p>
        
        <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
        <p>Showcrate is a platform that allows developers to create, host, and share interactive documentation using WebContainers. We reserve the right to modify or discontinue, temporarily or permanently, the service with or without notice.</p>

        <h2>3. User Responsibilities</h2>
        <p>You are responsible for any activity that occurs under your account. You must not use the service for any illegal or unauthorized purpose. You must not, in the use of the service, violate any laws in your jurisdiction.</p>

        <h2>4. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>The service and its original content, features, and functionality are and will remain the exclusive property of Showcrate and its licensors. The service is protected by copyright, trademark, and other laws.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</LandingLayout>
